---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="About Texty" description="Texty is a set of fast, free text tools that work in your browser, built by Sequence Industries." path="/about">
  <article class="wrap prose">
    <h1>About Texty</h1>
    <p>Texty solves small text problems quickly. Count words, fix messy spacing, change case, sort a list, compare two versions or rewrite a paragraph, then copy the result and get on with your day.</p>
    <p>There is nothing to install and no account to create. Most tools run entirely in your browser, which is why they are instant and why your text stays private.</p>
    <p>Texty is free and supported by advertising, kept away from the tools themselves. It is built by Sequence Industries.</p>
    <p>Spotted a bug or want a tool we don’t have yet? We’d like to hear about it.</p>
  </article>
</Base>

<style>
  .prose {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--s-4);
    max-width: calc(var(--measure) + 2 * var(--gutter));
    padding-top: var(--s-6);
  }
  .prose p {
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }
</style>
